//! Independent 100-digit depth certificates of the arc evidence and corner barrels.
//!
//! Each pair holds the round-down and round-up binary64 bits of the exact value. A
//! `minimum` holds the round-down bits of a true minimum of `d r / ds` in `s = y/D`.

// Generated by `transcribe.py` in `resource/evidence/culvert-shapes/` from its frozen
// `depths.json`. Regenerate instead of editing.

